# Sources: April 2006 UCI specification https://backscattering.de/chess/uci/
# (go, info, bestmove and quit), and the owner's 2026-11-25 D17 answers
# on fisher-5sg.10, recorded as fisher-r6y D49–D52 and D56.
# python-chess 1.11.2 independently enumerated h8g8 as the sole legal move.
> position fen 7k/8/5K1Q/8/8/8/8/8 b - - 0 1
> go btime 0
# D51 and D20 give zero time for the move and no info. UCI bestmove
# requires one move for the accepted go.
< bestmove h8g8

> go btime -500
# D51 and D20 give zero time for the move and no info. UCI bestmove
# requires one move for the accepted go.
< bestmove h8g8

# UCI quit and D25 require clean exit with no further output.
> quit
! exit
